# The SSH server (sshd, docs/NETWORK.md, man sshd_config).
# After a change: sudo svc restart sshd
Port 22
# ListenAddress ::          (the default: every address, IPv4 and IPv6)
# root: with a key only (prohibit-password), yes, or no
PermitRootLogin prohibit-password
PasswordAuthentication yes
PubkeyAuthentication yes
MaxAuthTries 6
